      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes, I use this option myself for a number of things; but the reality is that 98% of people wont know how to do this, and most users don't even have a custom avatar uploaded.   Integrating it into the app is a better way to go.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
