      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Fair point, In such case I cannot see how they would stop that since players will always remain visible one way or another on the screen alone. However it's something we can \"fix\" if we choose to not hangout around Desktop users due to this very reason. There are many \"bad\" content creators who record people without their consent & make fun out of them for some stupid views. There are some that I'm aware of, Even Polish community has some known \"disliked\" people who record without consent, Also blocking them is not enough since they make new account every time they want to record somebody for content. Also yes, In theory they could record directly in VR headset but that is much less likely. I'd like to see a feature that somehow fixes or combats that problem anyhow since I have to stay anxious & aware at all times without a break whenever on. After all your only ally & tool is your own ability to read the room, people's intentions & each word in between that was said so far.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
